    ". Repair: convert explicitly (`rule.arith.convert`) or fix the types.\n- `diag.unbounded-type-paramet"
    "er` — Summary: the type parameter's bound does not allow this. Phase: static. Rule: `rule.type.kin"
    "d`, `rule.type.bound` `[Bound-Missing]`. Required: only the permitted uses of `T`, and the operators"
    " its bound provides. Observed: an operator its bound (if any) does not provide, field access, or cal"
