    "diag.read-of-resource` for a static read or moved whole; `diag.type-mismatch` and `diag.literal-out-"
    "of-range` for an ill-formed static; `diag.borrow-of-non-place` for `&mut` of a constant.\n- 1.58.0 —"
    " `CHG-0319` (D-0257): `diag.extern-non-ffi-type` also from `[Extern-Entry]` (an `extern fn` with a b"
